01:58.477 --> 02:02.897
Hole

02:03.207 --> 02:05.207
<i>Fire Style: Majestic Flower Flame!</i>

02:05.787 --> 02:07.577
<i>Fire Style: Bomb Blast Dance!</i>

02:25.917 --> 02:26.997
We're safe!

02:27.077 --> 02:29.417
<i>If we didn't have</i>
<i>Naruto's Chakra Cloak,</i>

02:29.757 --> 02:32.267
<i>we'd be crisper than a roast pig!</i>

02:44.277 --> 02:45.277
The next round is coming!

02:56.077 --> 02:59.457
<i>Naruto's chakra has been protecting</i>
<i>everyone this whole time.</i>

02:59.957 --> 03:03.127
<i>Naruto, are you sure</i>
<i>you're okay to keep this going?</i>

03:08.387 --> 03:09.257
He's gone!

03:10.137 --> 03:11.467
Where'd he go?

03:11.757 --> 03:14.347
He disappeared... He escaped...

03:15.017 --> 03:17.347
<i>That's impossible. Find him!</i>

03:17.897 --> 03:19.267
Above you, Naruto!

03:25.527 --> 03:28.317
Naruto, you're only fighting
defensively now,

03:28.317 --> 03:30.447
trying to protect everyone.

03:34.407 --> 03:36.827
Is there any meaning to all of this?

03:37.287 --> 03:38.917
<i>Are you all right, Naruto?</i>

03:39.247 --> 03:42.417
<i>It's too much for you to control</i>
<i>the chakra that I gave you, all at once.</i>

03:43.087 --> 03:44.377
<i>You'll wear yourself out</i>
<i>in no time.</i>

03:44.917 --> 03:47.757
<i>Also, it looks like Ten Tails</i>
<i>is charging chakra,</i>

03:47.837 --> 03:48.877
<i>so you'd better watch out!</i>

03:53.137 --> 03:55.307
You're only growing weaker.

03:56.057 --> 03:59.397
I don't think you'd understand,
since you want to be alone...

04:00.347 --> 04:05.857
But having everyone by my side
makes me really, really happy!

04:07.487 --> 04:09.907
That alone gives me strength!

04:13.327 --> 04:14.367
Did he run away?

04:15.997 --> 04:19.457
If the pain of your comrades' deaths
is part of your bond...

04:19.707 --> 04:22.707
then there's no need
to protect them, right?

04:22.997 --> 04:25.247
What the hell,
you quibbling bastard?!

04:25.337 --> 04:28.087
That's what I hate about you!

04:28.667 --> 04:31.297
That's not what I‘m talking
about you, quibbling idiot!

04:31.547 --> 04:35.297
I'm saying I can endure any pain
if it involves my comrades.

04:35.427 --> 04:37.717
It means I don't want
to give them up!

04:38.507 --> 04:40.507
It might seem selfish
of me...

04:43.887 --> 04:49.227
But it's more painful for me to not
have any comrades in here!

04:51.977 --> 04:55.487
<i>Obito... What are you trying to</i>
<i>confirm through Naruto</i>?

05:04.707 --> 05:05.827
<i>Shannaro!</i>

05:07.997 --> 05:09.997
<i>There's no mistake!</i>

05:10.997 --> 05:12.627
<i>This chakra is...</i>

05:14.257 --> 05:16.377
<i>Hashirama!</i>

05:21.387 --> 05:23.517
Dad! It's collapsing!

05:24.177 --> 05:25.637
I can't hold it back any longer!

05:39.987 --> 05:42.197
Damn it, it's repelling
this Mountain Jutsu

05:42.327 --> 05:43.697
enhanced with Naruto's chakra!

05:44.197 --> 05:47.997
There's no other jutsu
that can stop it, Dad!

05:51.877 --> 05:53.417
<i>Bad news, Naruto!</i>

05:53.877 --> 05:56.127
<i>The Ten Tails is planning to</i>
<i>do the Cataclysm!</i>

05:56.717 --> 05:59.337
What the hell is that?
Cat-a-what?

05:59.387 --> 06:01.137
<i>Stop wasting time!</i>

06:01.257 --> 06:02.597
<i>The land's going to</i>
<i>be ripped apart!</i>

06:09.557 --> 06:11.607
It can't be controlled anymore,

06:11.687 --> 06:15.067
because you cut the link
between Ten Tails and me.

06:15.777 --> 06:19.277
Although I guess it's about time
I became its Jinchuriki.

06:40.547 --> 06:43.717
The real fun...
is just beginning!

06:48.177 --> 06:50.137
<i>This time, I'll make</i>
<i>the Ten Tails disappear!</i>

06:50.347 --> 06:51.187
Kamui!

06:51.937 --> 06:53.557
Looks like you were waiting
for your chance.

06:53.937 --> 06:56.937
But so was I, Kakashi.

06:57.277 --> 06:58.317
Kakashi Sensei!

06:58.567 --> 07:00.237
Naruto, you take care
of things here!

07:01.697 --> 07:02.737
Kakashi Sensei!

07:02.817 --> 07:04.907
<i>Here it comes! The Cataclysm!</i>

08:28.487 --> 08:31.157
That should have cleaned
most of them out.

08:39.457 --> 08:42.667
<i>Naruto protected us again.</i>

08:43.337 --> 08:44.677
<i>Naruto...</i>

08:50.387 --> 08:52.177
Is that all you've got?

09:26.087 --> 09:27.257
It's disappearing!

09:33.637 --> 09:36.387
Nice try pretending to be tough, but
it seems you've reached your limit.

09:36.477 --> 09:38.687
You've given me something
to look forward to...

09:38.767 --> 09:41.727
but I think it's time
you made your exit.

09:46.947 --> 09:49.867
Everyone! Let's join together
and fight as one!

09:49.947 --> 09:51.697
- Right!
- Right!

09:51.777 --> 09:52.737
Hinata!

09:53.077 --> 09:54.327
Time for you to recover!

10:02.167 --> 10:03.247
<i>You guys...</i>

10:04.957 --> 10:06.337
Such a futile demonstration.

10:11.087 --> 10:12.347
Lightning Blade!

10:22.227 --> 10:25.607
So there's still doubt
in your heart.

10:26.317 --> 10:29.397
You've had several chances to
kill me if you really wanted to.

10:30.447 --> 10:32.157
<i>One more blow!</i>

10:35.157 --> 10:37.327
It's pathetic that
you feel compassion

10:37.407 --> 10:39.327
towards an enemy
in the midst of fighting.

10:41.287 --> 10:42.787
Is it guilt?

10:43.957 --> 10:46.337
Are you feeling remorse
over the fact that

10:46.417 --> 10:50.927
you couldn't protect Rin and
keep your promise to me?

10:56.807 --> 10:59.727
Are you hoping that
I'll have a change of heart?

11:01.727 --> 11:04.397
Obito... Let's stop this already!

11:05.727 --> 11:08.647
Your dream long ago was
to become the Hokage...

11:10.237 --> 11:12.737
Naruto has the same dream.

11:14.737 --> 11:17.827
Naruto's words are exactly
what you used to say in the past.

11:19.407 --> 11:22.787
<i>I'm going to be the Hokage!</i>
<i>I'm Obito Uchiha!</i>

11:23.207 --> 11:25.537
<i>For my Great Stone Face,</i>

11:25.667 --> 11:30.167
<i>make sure my trademark goggles</i>
<i>and Sharingan are nicely carved out!</i>

11:30.587 --> 11:33.797
<i>My dream is to surpass</i>
<i>the Hokage someday!</i>

11:33.887 --> 11:38.427
<i>And... I'm going to make everyone</i>
<i>in the village accept me!</i>

11:39.267 --> 11:41.767
You haven't realized it...

11:41.847 --> 11:44.597
But you've been trying to merge
your past self with the current Naruto...

11:44.687 --> 11:48.277
Hearing the old you
in Naruto's words.

11:50.487 --> 11:54.407
Is it because you secretly want
to be repudiated by your old self?

11:56.367 --> 11:58.907
I can't see you not understanding
Naruto's feelings!

11:59.947 --> 12:03.287
You can still go back...
to the person you once were!

12:10.297 --> 12:12.877
It's because I understand
Naruto's mind...

12:12.967 --> 12:15.217
That I want to hear it all...

12:15.297 --> 12:18.467
And negate everything
that he does!

12:19.177 --> 12:20.427
<i>Obito...</i>

12:20.557 --> 12:23.017
By the way, let me tell you
one more thing.

12:23.437 --> 12:28.397
This guilt you feel towards me
is really presumptuous.

12:28.687 --> 12:33.567
If you believe that I started
this war simply over you and Rin...

12:34.147 --> 12:36.357
To call you misdirected,
would be an understatement!

12:42.247 --> 12:44.577
I know everything.

12:49.087 --> 12:52.167
I know that Rin deliberately ran
into your Lightning Blade.

12:52.207 --> 12:54.257
That she chose to die.

12:58.677 --> 13:01.807
Back then, Rin had been kidnapped
by the Hidden Mist

13:01.887 --> 13:04.387
and forced to become
the Three Tails' Jinchuriki.

13:05.557 --> 13:09.107
You succeeded in rescuing Rin
and got her out...

13:09.187 --> 13:13.397
But that was part of
the Hidden Mist's plan.

13:14.187 --> 13:16.147
They even pretended
to pursue you

13:16.237 --> 13:17.817
to get you home
to the Leaf quicker.

13:19.157 --> 13:21.277
How did you...?

13:29.327 --> 13:30.247
Damn it!

13:31.167 --> 13:32.417
You all stay here.

13:33.337 --> 13:35.667
Captain... Let's wait
for reinforcements.

13:36.257 --> 13:37.467
We don't have time...

13:38.257 --> 13:40.637
The Hidden Mist kidnapped Rin
in order to use her

13:40.717 --> 13:42.387
as some kind of test subject...

13:43.307 --> 13:45.307
If she's taken to
the Blood Mist Village,

13:45.307 --> 13:47.347
we'll never get her out.

13:47.807 --> 13:49.347
But you can't go alone!

13:50.057 --> 13:51.267
I won't be alone.

13:51.357 --> 13:52.817
Summoning Jutsu!

13:57.357 --> 13:58.487
Can you pick up Rin's scent?

13:58.607 --> 14:00.907
I remember it. Leave it to me.

14:01.407 --> 14:05.867
When the reinforcements arrive,
tell them that we went after Rin.

14:06.537 --> 14:07.827
Yes, sir.

14:14.667 --> 14:16.297
<i>Wait for me, Rin!</i>

14:16.297 --> 14:18.297
<i>I will definitely protect you!</i>

14:35.527 --> 14:36.567
It's the Leaf!

14:36.647 --> 14:38.487
A Leaf shinobi!

14:44.237 --> 14:46.447
All right! We're going
to divert the enemy!

14:54.707 --> 14:56.297
You guys wait here.

14:58.167 --> 14:59.167
This way, Kakashi.

15:12.767 --> 15:13.517
Rin!

15:18.647 --> 15:20.317
They put her under a genjutsu.

15:20.737 --> 15:21.737
Release!

15:25.077 --> 15:25.947
Kakashi!

15:27.827 --> 15:28.787
Let's get out of here!

15:35.207 --> 15:37.297
Leaf shinobi!
They have the captive!

15:37.957 --> 15:38.917
Hurry!

15:41.047 --> 15:42.297
Don't let them get away!

15:53.267 --> 15:54.347
Go!

15:54.397 --> 15:56.937
We'll divert the enemy.

15:57.477 --> 15:58.317
Thanks, I leave it to you.

15:58.527 --> 15:59.317
Save it.

15:59.397 --> 16:02.527
If we're driven into a corner,
we'll make a run for it too.

16:03.147 --> 16:04.277
Let's go, Rin.

16:05.777 --> 16:06.947
Kakashi...

16:09.077 --> 16:10.497
I... feel strange...

16:11.157 --> 16:12.537
We have to escape first.

16:13.577 --> 16:14.707
Scatter!

16:18.337 --> 16:20.297
I feel it...

16:20.587 --> 16:24.127
I feel like there's someone,
something else inside me.

16:24.547 --> 16:25.587
What are you talking about?

16:26.587 --> 16:27.637
I don't know.

16:28.137 --> 16:29.807
- There they are!
- Don't let them get away!

16:32.597 --> 16:33.887
We have to get past them!

16:40.027 --> 16:43.897
The Hidden Mist tried to perform
some kind of ritual on me.

16:43.987 --> 16:45.657
A special ritual.

16:46.447 --> 16:48.947
But I lost consciousness and...

16:55.037 --> 16:56.287
They're persistent!

16:56.497 --> 16:59.957
I can't return to the Leaf Village!

17:00.167 --> 17:01.337
What are you saying?!

17:01.917 --> 17:04.467
Kakashi, you have to kill me now!

17:04.837 --> 17:06.427
What are you saying, Rin?!

17:06.467 --> 17:08.177
They're using me.

17:08.757 --> 17:11.597
If I return, Hidden Leave Village
may be attacked!

17:11.677 --> 17:14.427
I promised Obito that
I would protect you!

17:14.517 --> 17:16.307
I can't do such a thing!

17:17.397 --> 17:19.517
There's got to be a way
out of this!

17:19.607 --> 17:22.107
In any case, we need
to make it to the village!

17:22.187 --> 17:23.317
No, Kakashi...

17:23.527 --> 17:25.197
I'll stop them.

17:26.397 --> 17:27.407
Now go!

17:27.487 --> 17:28.487
I can't...

17:35.247 --> 17:37.417
Once Rin made it back
to the Leaf,

17:37.497 --> 17:40.837
the Hidden Mist intended to make
the Three Tails rampage

17:40.957 --> 17:43.587
and attack the village.

17:56.557 --> 17:58.477
Rin realized this...

17:58.557 --> 18:03.267
And took advantage of the Lightning Blade
you aimed at the enemy...

18:03.267 --> 18:04.977
to commit suicide.

18:07.697 --> 18:11.487
She made up her mind to die
at the hands of the one she loved.

18:11.567 --> 18:13.447
In order to protect
the Hidden Leaf.

18:13.907 --> 18:15.787
No matter what you say,

18:15.867 --> 18:20.537
to me, you're still an impostor
who couldn't protect Rin.

18:21.497 --> 18:24.667
To me, Rin is someone
who wasn't supposed to die.

18:24.747 --> 18:28.417
So Rin dead is also an impostor.

18:30.257 --> 18:32.427
Rin is Rin because she is alive!

18:33.257 --> 18:35.637
The things that created
all these circumstances...

18:35.717 --> 18:39.517
The system of shinobi, village,
and the shinobi themselves...

18:40.017 --> 18:43.357
What caused me to despair,
is this world itself.

18:43.897 --> 18:45.937
This counterfeit world!

18:48.027 --> 18:49.527
Remember Naruto's words?

18:50.487 --> 18:52.777
That it's most painful

18:52.867 --> 18:54.827
not to have real comrades
inside one's heart?

18:55.197 --> 18:59.327
I quoted exactly what
you said long ago to him...

19:00.077 --> 19:03.997
I know the old you would have
resonated with that.

19:04.707 --> 19:07.257
And I still believe
the current you, can as well-!

19:07.257 --> 19:08.257
Look!

19:09.257 --> 19:11.757
There's nothing in my heart!

19:11.837 --> 19:14.507
I don't even feel pain anymore.

19:16.307 --> 19:18.517
Don't feel so guilty, Kakashi.

19:19.347 --> 19:23.267
This hole was opened
by this hellish world.

19:24.357 --> 19:27.317
In the past,
all I felt was pain here.

19:27.317 --> 19:29.317
What's the meaning in that?

19:29.687 --> 19:31.737
So I abandoned everything.

19:31.817 --> 19:35.367
You've been suffering all this time,
haven't you?

19:35.947 --> 19:39.947
As you stood at Rin's grave...
and at my grave.

19:42.667 --> 19:43.667
Kakashi...

19:44.287 --> 19:45.497
Enough already.

19:46.287 --> 19:48.587
You don't have to
suffer anymore.

19:49.417 --> 19:50.877
Rin is here.

19:51.087 --> 19:52.757
<i>I love you, Kakashi.</i>

19:53.587 --> 19:56.967
Along with your ideal version of me.

19:57.137 --> 19:59.267
<i>I'm gonna be Hokage!</i>

19:59.887 --> 20:01.637
You can wish for
whatever you want...

20:01.727 --> 20:05.397
You can have anything you
desire in this Genjutsu World.

20:05.937 --> 20:09.067
The hole in your heart
can be filled immediately.

20:11.187 --> 20:12.527
Rin is gone.

20:13.277 --> 20:15.567
You are still alive!

20:16.407 --> 20:18.367
